    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Mercenary Oathband",
    "summary": "Except through this rule, **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** units in your army have neither [Hostile Acquisition](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency) nor [Fortify Takeover](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency). They start the battle with [Hostile Acquisition](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency).\n\nAs your Command phase ends, you can spend 3YP to swap them: those units lose whichever of the 2 abilities they have and get the other.",
